{
    "0": {
        "0_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<ts$Ariya  $Marisa  $Saki  >Deep below the Asama Purifying Mountain."
            ]
        },
        "1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After a grueling battle, Marisa Kirisame",
                "defeated Ariya Iwanaga, the goddess of unchanging."
            ]
        },
        "6_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> However...”"
            ]
        },
        "7_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >“A torrent of impurity from the Outside World will also rush in."
            ]
        },
        "8_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> What happens after that... is in your hands.”"
            ]
        },
        "10_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >“Why don’t you witness for yourself how Gensokyo changes?”"
            ]
        },
        "11_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Forest of Magic."
            ]
        },
        "39_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Congratulations!$>",
                "<c$Congratulations on your No Continue Clear!$>"
            ]
        },
        "2_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >“That Incident Stone was certainly the real deal."
            ]
        },
        "3_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> Thanks to you, I can take some time off work. I'm grateful.”"
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“Wait, return Gensokyo to normal first!”"
            ]
        },
        "5_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >“You needn’t worry. Once I withdraw my power, Gensokyo should return to normal."
            ]
        },
        "9_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“What? ‘In my hands’...? What do you mean?”"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A deep, dark forest where all manner of evil spirits creep ever closer."
            ]
        },
        "13_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Saki  >“Found you!”"
            ]
        },
        "14_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“Guh, you're that one from the Animal Realm...”"
            ]
        },
        "15_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Saki  >“Saki, boss of the Keiga Family! Bow before me!”"
            ]
        },
        "17_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Saki  >“What’s with the cold shoulder?"
            ]
        },
        "16_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“Why are you in a place like this?”"
            ]
        },
        "18_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> My grunts told me that a magician from the surface",
                "<l$> had an aura similar to my own.”"
            ]
        },
        "19_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“Ahh, could it be this Incident Stone?”"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Saki  >“That’s it! It definitely feels the same kind of aura as me.”"
            ]
        },
        "21_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Saki  >“Man, I’m so happy.",
                "<l$> You’ve finally made up your mind, huh?”"
            ]
        },
        "22_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“Huuh?”"
            ]
        },
        "23_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Saki  >“You must’ve been drawn to our Keiga Family, right?",
                "<l$> You’re always welcome to join. I’ll even make you an executive.”"
            ]
        },
        "24_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“Whoa, hold on, I have no plans to become a Yakuza."
            ]
        },
        "25_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> But this Incident Stone did come in handy."
            ]
        },
        "26_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> Did you make this thing?”"
            ]
        },
        "27_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Saki  >“Hmm, I don’t remember...",
                "<l$> But if it has my power, I probably did.”"
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Saki  >“Yes, of course I made it!"
            ]
        },
        "29_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> If you work under me, you can have as many as you want.”"
            ]
        },
        "30_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“This’s going nowhere."
            ]
        },
        "31_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> There’s no way a muscle-head like you could make",
                "<l$> a magic item as sophisticated as this Incident Stone.”"
            ]
        },
        "32_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It was clear the Incident Stone’s origin wasn’t from the muscle-headed Keiga Family."
            ]
        },
        "33_0": {
            "lines": [
                "However, it’s true that the Keiga Family’s power helped resolve the incident."
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "When Gensokyo started rejecting change, a stone imbued with the",
                "power of an incident that thrived on change appeared before Marisa."
            ]
        },
        "35_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It would be impossible to dismiss it as mere coincidence."
            ]
        },
        "36_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In that case, to get to the bottom of this,",
                "maybe cooperating with the Keiga Family for a bit wouldn’t be so bad..."
            ]
        },
        "37_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...or so thought Marisa."
            ]
        },
        "38_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Ending No.10 — Incidents are Just Another Form of Firepower!$>"
            ]
        }
    }
}